n- My first request to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list, it showed nothing, so I sent the request again. That created INC-0002.\n- A later check showed the first request had actually gone through as INC-0001. The list just hadn't shown it yet.\n- So there are now two identical open SEV2 incidents for checkout-api. Each one describes the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, the recovery, and a follow-up to find the cause before redeploying v2.3.1.\n- I can't close or merge incidents, so someone will need to close INC-0002 as a duplicate of INC-0001. It's worth telling the on-call engineer that the second page was the same issue.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012z7VWaZ4dHU89B8ezveQpL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KQuS9yfZNZ2VYpCQUnYywt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016isCvybPR3XaxmVbmv9LDu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012sa335eMuQ8cPRDykKEVCi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017eCHv9YQP1fdBgBMiJg7pq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01EWukxqDx5aYvYcSrKbX75t", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deplo